{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/lem-jet-prolongation-categorical-jet","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Lemma","doco:Section"],"label":"lem:jet-prolongation-categorical-jet","kind":"lemma","title":"The base object is a direct summand of the jet object $J^1(S)$","proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-jet-prolongation-categorical-jet"],"cites":["references/fred2005"],"tags":["kahler-differential","frobenius-hopf","jet-bundle","deformation"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.LiftingDescent.jp_categorical_jet","text":"jet-prolongation-categorical-jet.md","leanSource":"jet-prolongation-categorical-jet.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"lem:jet-prolongation-categorical-jet\"></a><p><em>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">S</code> be a commutative algebra over a commutative ring <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code>, let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">I = \\ker(m\\colon S\\otimes S \\to S)</code>, and let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">J^1(S) := (S \\otimes S)/I^2</code> be the <a href=\"#def:categorical-jet\" data-at=\"quantum-universes/qu-structures\">jet object</a>. The section <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\ell(a) = [a \\otimes 1]</code> and the left inverse <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">r\\colon J^1(S) \\to S</code> induced by <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">m</code> are <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">R</code>-algebra maps with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">r \\circ \\ell = \\mathrm{id}_S</code>, and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\ker r = I/I^2 = \\Omega^1_{S/R}</code>. Hence <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">J^1(S) = \\ell(S) \\oplus \\Omega^1_{S/R}</code>, and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">S</code> is a direct summand of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">J^1(S)</code>.</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/jet-prolongation-categorical-jet.md","heading":"Lemma","number":"6.1.3","page":"b/lem-jet-prolongation-categorical-jet","qa":{"counts":{"pass":67,"fail":1,"warn":0,"na":51,"unknown":0,"stale":119},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.LiftingDescent.LiftingDescentRoot.jetRetract_comp_jetSection","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/MathlibExt/JetModuleSplitting.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
